                    <msContents>
                        <summary xml:lang="">
                            <p>Two large fragments of Abū l Faraǧ Furqān b. Asad’s Torah commentary on <emph rend="italic">Parashat Qedušim</emph> and <emph rend="italic">Parashat Emor</emph>. Contains the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 19:1–37 (fols. 1v–7v), the commentary on Lev 19:1,22–23 (fols. 8r–18v), the commentary on Lev 23:1–22 (fols. 19r–29v, 36r–46r), the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 23:23–25 (fol. 46r-v), the commentary on Lev 23:23–25 (fols. 46v–49v), the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 23:26–32 (fols. 49v–50v), the commentary on Lev 23:26–32 (fols. 50v–54v), the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 23:33–44 (fols. 54v–56v), the commentary on Lev 23:33–44 (fols. 56v–63v), the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 24:1–4 (fol. 63v–64r), the commentary on Lev 24:1–4 (fols. 64v–65r), the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 24:5–9 (fols. 65r–66r), the commentary on Lev 24:5–9 (fols. 66r–68r), the Arabic-script transcription and translation of Lev 24:10–23 (fols. 68r–70r), the commentary on Lev 24:10–23 (fols. 70r–73r; 73v–74v are empty). Fols. 30–35 are in a different hand and contain the commentary on Deut 1:12–18 by the same author.</p>
                        </summary>
                        <msItem xml:id="item-1.1" class="">
                            <title ref="https://jalit.org/work/80">Commentary on the Torah (Yešuʿa ben Yehuda)</title>
                            <locus from="" to=""/>
                            
                            <author ref="https://jalit.org/person/11">Yešuʿa ben Yehuda</author>
                            <textLang mainLang="ar" otherLangs=""/>
                            <incipit>
                                <locus from="1v" to=""/>
                                <quote xml:lang="ar">
                                    <p>بشيم ىىا ايل عولام<lb/>باروخ هو لعولام<lb/>فراشه<lb/>مقدمه<lb/>كو اامار ىىا جوايل يسراايل قدوشو [Is 49:7]</p>
                                </quote>
                            </incipit>
                            <explicit>
                                <locus from="73r" to=""/>
                                <quote xml:lang="ar">
                                    <p>وهايا صادق ايزور متناو وهاامونا ايزور حلاصاو :ﮦ [והיה צדק אזור מתניו והאמונה אזור חלציו, Is 11:5] ىراحماو</p>
                                </quote>
                            </explicit>
                            <note xml:lang="">
                                <p>Parashah heading (fol. 1v):<lb/>فراشه	<lb/>مقدمه<lb/>Fol. 19v<lb/>القول في الباب الثاني<lb/>Fol. 20r<lb/>القول في الباب الثالث<lb/>Fol. 23r<lb/>القول في الباب الرابع<lb/>Fol. 25v<lb/>الكلام في الاحتجاجات ... كل منه الى يوم</p>
                                <p>Title page (fol. 1r):<lb/>قراشة قدوشيم<lb/>פראש׳ קדושים ואמר</p>
                            </note>
                        </msItem>
